{"kind":"pr","url":"https://github.com/Merilairon/colours-of-safety/pull/1","repo":"Merilairon/colours-of-safety","number":1,"set":"agent","source":"devin","title":"Colours of Safety: queer-friendly map (Angular + NestJS + PostGIS)","body":"## Summary\n\nNew full-stack app for marking **queer-friendly (LGBTQIA+ safe)** places (POIs) and districts on OpenStreetMap, runnable with a single `docker compose up`. Viewing approved markings is public; submitting requires an account, and a **reviewer** must approve a submission before it appears on the public map.\n\n**Stack:** Angular 21 (standalone, signals, Leaflet + leaflet-draw) · NestJS 11 (TypeORM, Passport JWT) · PostgreSQL 16 + PostGIS 3.4 · nginx (serves SPA + proxies `/api`).\n\n### Review workflow\n```\nuser submits POI/district  ->  status = pending  (hidden from public)\nreviewer GET /api/{pois,districts}/pending\nreviewer PATCH .../:id/review {status: approved|rejected, reviewNote?}\nstatus = approved  ->  shown on public map, colour-coded by safety rating (1–5)\n```\n\n### Data model (PostGIS, SRID 4326)\n- `Poi`: `location` `geometry(Point)`, name/description/category/safetyRating, status, createdBy/reviewedBy\n- `District`: `area` `geometry(Polygon)`, same review fields\n- `User`: email/displayName/passwordHash, `role` ∈ {`user`, `reviewer`}\n\n### API (prefix `/api`)\n`POST /auth/register` · `POST /auth/login` · `GET /auth/me` · `GET /pois|/districts` (public, approved only) · `GET .../mine` (author) · `GET .../pending` (reviewer) · `POST /pois|/districts` (auth) · `PATCH .../:id/review` (reviewer).\n\n### Notable decisions\n- **Public endpoints must not leak contributor emails.** `User.email` and `passwordHash` are `@Exclude()`d and a global `ClassSerializerInterceptor` strips them from any entity response (e.g. an approved POI's `createdBy`). Auth endpoints return plain objects, so they still include email where needed.\n- Review uses `repository.update(...)` + reload instead of `save()` on the eager-loaded entity, because the eager `reviewedBy` relation (null) would otherwise overwrite the `reviewedById` FK back to null.\n- Frontend uses Leaflet `circleMarker` + `leaflet-draw` `circlemarker`/`polygon` tools, avoiding the bundler marker-icon asset issue entirely.\n- A default reviewer account is seeded on first boot (`reviewer@colours-of-safety.org` / `reviewer123`, configurable via env).\n\n### Run\n```bash\ncp .env.example .env   # optional\ndocker compose up --build   # app on http://localhost:8080\n```\n\n### Verification\n- Backend: `npm run build` / `npm run lint` / `npm test` (8 tests) all pass.\n- Frontend: `npm run build` and `npm test` (2 tests) pass.\n- Full `docker compose` stack verified end-to-end via API: register → submit POI (pending, hidden) → reviewer approves → appears publicly; same for district polygons; reviewer-only routes return 403 for normal users; PostGIS geometry round-trips as GeoJSON; emails confirmed absent from public responses.\n\n\nLink to Devin session: https://app.devin.ai/sessions/3cc4002fdebe4163bfc4949fa7fb25a9\nRequested by: @Merilairon","authorType":"Bot","additions":23529,"deletions":1,"changedFiles":97,"files":[{"path":".env.example","additions":19,"deletions":0},{"path":".gitignore","additions":9,"deletions":0},{"path":"README.md","additions":98,"deletions":1},{"path":"backend/.dockerignore","additions":6,"deletions":0},{"path":"backend/.gitignore","additions":17,"deletions":0},{"path":"backend/.prettierrc","additions":4,"deletions":0},{"path":"backend/Dockerfile","additions":18,"deletions":0},{"path":"backend/README.md","additions":98,"deletions":0},{"path":"backend/eslint.config.mjs","additions":35,"deletions":0},{"path":"backend/nest-cli.json","additions":8,"deletions":0},{"path":"backend/package-lock.json","additions":10935,"deletions":0},{"path":"backend/package.json","additions":84,"deletions":0},{"path":"backend/src/app.module.ts","additions":33,"deletions":0},{"path":"backend/src/auth/auth.controller.ts","additio